      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "……え？　なっ、なぜですっ！　怪物どもが逃げていく！？\nこらぁ！　戻りなさいっ！　発情してヤツらを襲うのです！　",
      "jp_sha256": "92aaf8f45288a1336edb96b8c13480764f2d066cd10847835c845ec2d98dd4f4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "……어? 왜, 왜죠! 괴물들이 도망가잖아!?\n이봐요! 돌아오세요! 발정해서 저 녀석들을 덮치란 말이에요!　",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 34,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
